						[104] = "Gated by MQ100 (if Krisk takes over)\n\nIt's the first day of business after the events of MQ100.\n\nAn abundance of contraband has croped up in the market. An influx of criminals have come to the Thieves' Quarter to find illegal goods on the cheap. Kay overhears some bounty hunters negotiating for new weapons. Kay interjects to see what's on offer.\n\nThe vendor tells Kay there's a massive influx of buyers and they're running low on stock. They ask Kay to negotiate for more weapons with the Ashiga Clan, and that there's a free blaster modifer in it for her.",
